privacy=intro('Website information','Your <em>privacy.</em>','How this website handles browsing and enquiry information.','<p class="reading-time">Updated 28 October 2026</p>')
privacy+='''<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow prose policy"><h2>Browsing this website</h2><p>The site serves its fonts, images, styles and scripts locally. It does not use advertising pixels, embedded social feeds, analytics scripts or tracking cookies in the current version. Our hosting provider may process technical connection information, such as IP addresses and request logs, to deliver and protect the site.</p><h2>Making an enquiry</h2><p>The enquiry form prepares an email draft on your device. It does not submit the form to a website database. The information reaches Holy Elixir when you send that email through your chosen email service. You can also call or email us directly.</p><h2>What to include</h2><p>Share the contact details and product or business information needed to answer your question. Please avoid sending sensitive personal information that is unnecessary for an enquiry.</p><h2>Other websites</h2><p>If you follow an external educational link, that destination operates under its own privacy practices. Email and telephone links use the applications you choose on your device.</p><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:Info@holy-elixir.com">Info@holy-elixir.com</a> to ask about enquiry information you have sent or to request a correction. Include enough context to identify the enquiry.</p><h2>Changes to this notice</h2><p>We will update this page when the website’s information-handling features change. The date above identifies this version.</p></div></section>'''
add('privacy.html','Privacy Notice | Zubrex by Holy Elixir','How the Holy Elixir website handles browsing information and email enquiries.',privacy,'Information')
terms=intro('Website information','A few useful <em>notes.</em>','Information about this website, its imagery and the enquiry process.','<p class="reading-time">Updated 28 October 2026</p>')
terms+='''<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow prose policy"><h2>Product information</h2><p>This website introduces the Zubrex collection and helps you contact the Holy Elixir team. Product information is being updated. Refer to the current physical label and model-specific documentation for ingredients, instructions, specifications and warnings.</p><h2>Campaign imagery</h2><p>Campaign visuals include AI-assisted concept scenes supplied in the creative presentation and earlier lifestyle concepts. Packaging, settings and appliance features shown in illustrative artwork can differ from the current physical product. The Black Drink page includes a supplied actual product photograph for reference.</p><h2>Enquiries and orders</h2><p>The site does not operate an online checkout, collect payments or automatically confirm orders. Sending an enquiry requests a conversation. Product availability, pricing, quantities, delivery, warranty and any commercial arrangements must be confirmed directly before an order.</p><h2>Educational content</h2><p>Guides explain product terminology and help you ask useful questions. They do not provide individual medical advice or promise health outcomes.</p><h2>Using the site</h2><p>Please use the site and contact channels for genuine product, service or business enquiries. If a page seems inaccurate or a link is broken, tell us through the <a href="contact.html">contact page</a>.</p><h2>Accessibility and motion</h2><p>The website supports keyboard navigation and reduced-motion preferences. Use the motion controls to pause animated campaign scenes and the update notice. If you need information in another format, contact our team.</p></div></section>'''
add('terms.html','Website Notes | Zubrex by Holy Elixir','Notes on product information, campaign imagery, enquiries and using the Holy Elixir website.',terms,'Information')

